        <mxCell id="legend" value="&lt;b&gt;Architecture Flow Legend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;font style='font-size:10px;color:#334155'&gt;[1] Amber: Edge CDC / Lakehouse Federation (Oracle -&amp;gt; Databricks)    [2] Blue Dashed: Zero-Copy Delta Sharing / Iceberg Uniform (No ETL Duplication)    [3] Emerald: Zero-Trust Private MCP over mTLS (Tokenized PII Only)    [4] Gold/Green: FinOps Tiered Routing (Flash 85% / Pro 15%)    [5] Cyan: Salesforce Private Connect &amp;amp; Data Cloud Zero-Copy&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f1f5f9;strokeColor=#64748b;fontColor=#0f172a;fontSize=11;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
